<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1" title="View the profile of Kinladar">Kinladar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Ranger Bait<br />
								Moderator<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/starmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14489<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/macross.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My Avatar can beat up your avatar!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/kinladar@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="kinladar@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org" title="http://www.rodcetnife.org" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:truman@thewavz.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14147#msg14147"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14147#msg14147">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> February 02, 2005, 10:54:38 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14142#msg14142">Quote from: Shakro on February 02, 2005, 08:18:06 am</a></div><div class="quote">If bazaar numbers are your indicator, fair enough.  There are currently 303 in the bazaar, looking at my trader atm.  Considerably more than the 150 you listed earlier.  Does that mean people are coming back?<br /></div><br />Neither of our examples are perfect, you&#039;d really need to take nightly samples from multiple servers.<br /><br />But if anything, I would say things have somewhat stabilized, but are not making any kind of reversal.<br /><br />Alot will depend on DoN, and how much interest it generates. Some people do come back for expansions, even if only for a month or two to see the new stuff.<br /><br />If it&#039;s a total crap expansion, as I tend to think it will be based on what I have read on it so far, then the numbers won&#039;t jump nearly as high.<br /><br />I just see them picking up the Firiona Vie story line, that has laid dormant for so long, and trying to twist something out of it. Adding some flash to guilds with the guild hall concept, that actually does sound somewhat interesting, but they are not adding enough to really flesh out the game.<br /><br />Just looking at the half assed reworking of Mistmoore, and Splitpaw makes me think this.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.wowrankings.com/viewb.htm?name=Kinladar&amp;s_id=38" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/sig-kinladar-wow.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><a href="http://www.chaoticdiscord.org" target="_blank">Chaotic Discord</a> found in {World of Warcraft}<br />Guild Leader of Fires of Time (Retired)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14149"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=371" title="View the profile of Shakro">Shakro</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 81<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/coolbear.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=24026767" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=24026767&amp;img=5" alt="24026767" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=371"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14149#msg14149"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14149#msg14149">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #16 on:</b> February 02, 2005, 11:11:07 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Still haven&#039;t been to new MM or Paw.&nbsp; Have seen some nice stuff linked from those places, especially MM.&nbsp; I want to go.&nbsp; I think some people are shying away from those zones because of their old reputation.&nbsp; Old MM was a train station from hell, pathing and mob placement in the new version is likely to equate to the same trains.&nbsp; Old Paw - people <i>never</i> went to splitpaw before, past the door anyway.&nbsp; In Paw I think that was partly the pathing but also because there was such a variety of mobs there - where else could you find warriors, clerics, shaman, enchanters, and mage mobs in the same zone, sometimes in the same pull?&nbsp; They did fine with revamps in CT, Nurga, Droga, VP and Hate though, so I&#039;m willing to give these a shot.&nbsp; <br /><br />I&#039;m glad they&#039;re picking up the Firona Vie storyline, btw.&nbsp; Most people I&#039;ve spoken with are glad to see a return to core EQ stories, not some weird alien world, goofy named stuff.&nbsp; Incorporate old school stuff like Nagafen, Vox, Mayong, etc. and I&#039;ll be happy.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Shakro Shakdaddy<br />70 Fateseer of Bertoxxulous<br />Brew Masters
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14150"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393" title="View the profile of Zerxes">Zerxes</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 82<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14150#msg14150"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14150#msg14150">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #17 on:</b> February 02, 2005, 11:22:03 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"> DoN is going to be a shadow of what a real expansion should be. This whole concept of pushing out an expansion every 6 months is what is making the game appear so shallow, and meaningless. </div><br />Interestingly enough, that is the business model for EQ2 as well - a new expansion every 6 months.<br /><br />Blizzard&#039;s model is probably an expansion every 2 years&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" />&nbsp; We need a happy medium!<br /><br />I doubt EQ is going to generate any new players, and any people returning for DoN will probably be few and their stay short-lived.&nbsp; The &quot;oooooh&quot; and &quot;ahhhhhh&quot; factor of a new expansion lasts about 30 days tops these days (and for me, the last time I was going &quot;oooooooh&quot; for an expansion was GoD).<br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14151"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 399<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14151#msg14151"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14151#msg14151">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #18 on:</b> February 02, 2005, 11:22:36 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							You&#039;d think if they have any stories or old mobs the players still want to see, they&#039;d pull those out of the bag now (e.g. Mayong Mistmoore).  The game is near the end of its lifecycle.  Anything else of interest should be used.  They&#039;ve already called EQ2 an alternate Norrath in the future and excused themselves from having to make the storyline of EQ1 make any sense at all in context with EQ2, so that&#039;s not really a concern.  <br /><br />I remember that gnoll in old Paw who was up on the bridge just inside the double doors.  If you aggroed him, he would take a long, convaluted run down to you, bringing a huge train with him.    <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br />A few people on everquest.com are complaining about the zone revamp and even claiming mid levels liked to go to Paw.  lol... <br />what?  3 mid levels on each server?   <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cwm20.gif" alt="cwm20" border="0" /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">(and for me, the last time I was going &quot;oooooooh&quot; for an expansion was GoD).</div><br />And that wore off fairly quickly the further most people got into the expansion and realized how much it blew.&nbsp; I felt ahead of the game calling it suck ass from the beginning.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/biteme.gif" alt="biteme" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: February 02, 2005, 11:24:17 am by Callon</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
