							Yeah but take in to consideration supply and demand....the prices have steadly declined because people simply wern&#039;t willing to pay 20 k for a rune.&nbsp; Now I have noticed Murmite runes for under 10K in the bazaar&nbsp; the lessers are around 15k still but I dont doubt that those will go down too.&nbsp; Even in RL remember when DVD players were ungodly expensive.... you can get them for 25-30 bucks...and evenless if you go after thanksgiving LOL&nbsp; ....<br /><br />Eshebala
