	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14185"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=991" title="View the profile of Brandeewine">Brandeewine</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 15<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.brandeewine.com/IMGicon.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								HAHAHA!...I mean...That&#039;s terrible!...<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=991"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.sonsofkings.com" title="Sons of Kings" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:brandeewine16@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14185#msg14185"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14185#msg14185">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #25 on:</b> February 03, 2005, 12:46:27 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							/starts to comment on this thread...<br />/slips on Bobo&#039;s bananas and bumps head...<br />O.o<br />(sorry, couldn&#039;t help myself)<br /><br />I&#039;m looking forward to the guild hall features coming out. However I personally would be much more pleased if they&#039;d work more on the characters abilities to solo, as that&#039;s one thing that has driven me away from EQ lately. I miss the lower levels because I could log on when I had only an hour to play, and get some XP without searching for a group or buffing up to actually be able to defeat the mobs we went up against. EQ is a drain on RL time. It&#039;s hard to rationalize over and over if the game really is more important than real life. If they&#039;d make it easier to get in, play a little and then stop, I think it would help the game survive. After all, who likes to hurry up only to end up sitting around waiting, essentially wasting valuable time? But now I&#039;m just babbling....
						</td>
					</tr>
