								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14187#msg14187">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #26 on:</b> February 03, 2005, 12:48:35 am &#187;</span></td>
