								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14197#msg14197"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14197#msg14197">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #27 on:</b> February 03, 2005, 10:24:53 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ability to log in when your short on time and have something to do is one of the high points of WoW, from what I hear.&nbsp; &nbsp;Though I&#039;ve also heard from some that soloing has gone the other way and is perhaps too easy.&nbsp; Is there enough incentive to get a group?<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
