	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg14199"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=809" title="View the profile of Aegeis">Aegeis</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=809"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:tgamble@cableone.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14199#msg14199"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1399.msg14199#msg14199">Re: And so it begins...</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #28 on:</b> February 03, 2005, 11:01:35 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I group nightly in WoW but it is with friends and we tend to take on mobs a couple of lvls above us for a challenge. If none of my friends are on I at least can go and solo. Is it to easy? Depends, if you take on things that are 2 or 3 lvls or more below you then yes it is quite easy. Move to an area where mobs are a lvl or 2 above you and its a nice challenge. I find that I can&#039;t stay logged into EQ anymore, even when i want to log on and say hi and EQ2 didnt last long for me after lvl 20. I won&#039;t say wow is perfect, but it is the closest thing to a game and not a time sink that I have played.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
